Hey team,

Just got off a call with the SRE team. They confirmed that the load balancer
rules are in place and traffic shaping is ready. We can do the cutover on
Friday at 22:00 UTC as planned.

One thing they flagged: the /v1/users/bulk endpoint is still getting ~2k RPM
from the mobile app. We need to make sure the v1 compatibility shim stays up
for at least 2 more weeks. I've added it to the runbook.

Checklist before cutover:
 - [x] Database migration scripts tested on staging
 - [x] Rate limiting configured on API gateway
 - [x] Monitoring dashboards updated
 - [ ] Rollback procedure documented (Dave, can you finish this today?)
 - [ ] Mobile team notified about deprecation timeline

Let me know if anything else is missing.

- Alice

